  <title type="string">Towards how to hang a painting upside down on purpose (AILCA access S: Subscribers only)</title>
  <description type="string">The artist talks about the long argument with the colour blue. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls &quot;the elder&quot;.</description>
